    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are excited to present No. 114 The Green, Clonard Village to the market. This spacious own door, two bedroomed, top floor apartment is located in the ever popular Clonard Village Development. \n \nThis excellent property which extends to C. 73sqm is laid out with an open plan living/kitchen/dining room with two bedrooms and two bathrooms and the added benefit of a balcony off the living area. \n\nThe property comes to the market in excellent condition and this fine apartment would make an excellent first time buy, retirement home or investment property. \n\nClonard Village is an attractive modern development of houses and apartments, situated in a superb location on the outskirts of Wexford Town and close to all facilities including schools, shops and leisure amenities. The N25/M11 and Wexford Hospital are just a few minutes drive from the development.\n\nEarly viewing recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - c.4.3m x c.7.5m\nwith timber floor.\n\nLiving Room - c.4.7m x c.4.4m\nwith timber floor, patio door to balcony.\n\nKitchen - c.3.3m x c.2.5m\nwith timber floor, fitted kitchen.\n\nBathroom - c.2.3m x c.1.8m\nwith wc, whb, bath, tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - c.2.6m x c.4.2m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - c.1.9m x c.2.5m\nwith wc, whb, shower, floor tiling.\n\nBedroom 2 - c.2.7m x c.3.1m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
